# @env dev

### Register user
POST {{apiUrl}}/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nixon",
  "email": "seriiburduja@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login (сохраняем token из ответа)
# @env-json-key token $.accessToken
POST {{apiUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "seriiburduja@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Refresh token (берём refresh cookie из cookie-jar и обновляем token)
# @attach-cookie-jar
# @env-json-key token $.accessToken
POST {{apiUrl}}/v1/auth/refresh
Accept: application/json

### Refresh token
POST {{apiUrl}}/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### Logout user
POST {{apiUrl}}/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### Me (используем token)
GET {{apiUrl}}/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
